config MONA2_AUTOMOUSE_CANCEL
	bool "Drop the auto mouse layer when a normal key is typed"
	default n
	help
	  The pmw3610 driver only drops its auto mouse layer on a timer, so for
	  CONFIG_PMW3610_AUTOMOUSE_TIMEOUT_MS milliseconds after touching the
	  trackball the keys that the mouse layer overrides stay overridden.
	  Enable this to drop the layer as soon as an ordinary key is emitted.
	  Mouse buttons and held modifiers keep the layer alive.

config MONA2_AUTOMOUSE_CANCEL_LAYER
	int "Index of the auto mouse layer"
	depends on MONA2_AUTOMOUSE_CANCEL
	default 1
	help
	  Must match the automouse-layer property of the trackball node.
